# Story workflow

1. User names a story ID (`P1-S1` … `P6-S4`). If they do not, ask for one.
2. Read `docs/stories/<id>-*.md` and PLAN.md.
3. Change only listed packages.
4. If Contract changes is not none, update `packages/contracts` (Zod) and `packages/py-contracts` (Pydantic) first.
5. Do not start a different phase's work.
6. When acceptance criteria pass, check the box in PLAN.md.

Story source of truth is `docs/stories.catalog.json`. Regenerated markdown lives in `docs/stories/`. Do not hand-edit generated files; run `node scripts/generate-stories.mjs`.
